<item><title>Wapinda youth group urges stronger Ebola response as suspected cases top 400</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/wapinda-youth-group-urges-stronger-ebola-response-as-327a78/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/wapinda-youth-group-urges-stronger-ebola-response-as-327a78/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>The group reports 7 confirmed cases and 2 deaths, and says health teams lack fuel, medicines and ambulances to reach patients.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 06:40:55 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>WHO calls for immediate, safe evacuation of Ebola response team in Ituri</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/who-calls-for-immediate-safe-evacuation-of-ebola-response-9924c5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/who-calls-for-immediate-safe-evacuation-of-ebola-response-9924c5/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>WHO Director-General Tedros Adhanom Ghebreyesus reported a worrying security situation around a hospital in Ituri province, near the outbreak&apos;s initial focus.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:45:48 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/who-calls-for-immediate-safe-evacuation-of-ebola-response-9924c5/share.jpg" length="45029" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/who-calls-for-immediate-safe-evacuation-of-ebola-response-9924c5/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
